WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
If an evaluative premise is required to
bridge the is-ought gap,

2
00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:07.340
we must determine where to securely source
that premise.

3
00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:12.200
Rather than relying on intuition, we use
structured normative frameworks as

4
00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:15.080
the verified source for our evaluative
premises.

5
00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:20.600
The first framework, deontologism,
evaluates actions based on strict rules and

6
00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:25.620
duties rather than outcomes. It uses
concepts like role-based obligations,

7
00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:29.720
the universality principle, and the
respect for persons principle to supply

8
00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:30.760
more directives.
